title The phases a run reads back out of its own loss note, read once for the whole ladder
prompt Autonomous loop -- Kyri and Radiant first, REMEMBER, the itineraries, the newest logs' recommend, Standfast on reds, one council-rota row, then the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, sent as its own signed round
think Standfast opened the lap. The living REDS rows all read CLOSED -- %81, %83, %84, %98, %127 -- and the era suite answered GREEN at nine, its ninth rung proving the ledger's headline recites the count its own guard measures off disk. No open agent-closable red stood, so the line was clear for constructive work.
think The running thread came out of the tree rather than the card. The working tree held an uncommitted lap: forty-one caravan modules modified, 729 lines deleted, and `git diff caravan/abate.rye` named it at once -- the twenty-line `lost_published` body lifted into `caravan/ladder_checks.rye` behind a comptime `rung` parameter. The prior round had made every edit and had not verified or sent. So this lap's crux was already chosen and half-built; finishing it beat opening anything new.
think Verified the lift by measurement rather than by reading the diff for feel. Forty rungs call `ladder_checks.lost_published`, forty-one declare the name, and the one that does not delegate is the harness itself -- the exclusion by name that a prior lap learned to write rather than to get by luck.
think Checked the widening the witness prose claimed. `note_path` now publishes in bear, appraise, mend, and recant; the seven rungs that never declare `lost_published` -- abandon, confer, entrust, reckon, reclaim, revoke, taper -- keep it private exactly as written. A widening that follows a real caller is meaning; a widening applied uniformly would be drift.
think Ran the meters on a quiet tree, one at a time, because REDS learned two `rye build` runs racing on one staging path read as a witness failure. Carry witness GREEN at carried=78265 against ceiling 78271; copy witness GREEN with the roster whole at 107; the Caravan choir GREEN across all 107; TAME bans clean; width silent at exit 0; radiant-negation GREEN before the send.
obs The arithmetic held to the digit for the fifth lap running. The scan counts carried as (copies - 1) x lines, so 39 x 20 became 39 x 1 -- a fall of 663, and 663 is what the meter measured. Delegates rose 2,696 to 2,736, exactly the forty stubs, which is how a reader tells a fold from a cost moved somewhere cheaper to count.
obs Every rung wrote one identical body this time. Four families running had carried an odd rung whose own subject was the family's subject -- deem, owe, avow, meet each reaching a report directly where the family reached through an accessor. No rung's subject is the loss note, so no rung had cause to differ, and the absence of the exception is itself the explanation.
obs The next head reorders on the widening question rather than on lines. `renew_path` leads by realized fall at about 720 and stands private in all thirty-one; `press_path` returns about 648 and is already public everywhere, so it is the Lindy-first pick for a lap that wants the fall without opening a seam.
obs Council rota, Water and Venus -- care and flow. Gall's Law priced this whole arc: the ladder is a grown system, and each fold keeps it working at its current size rather than redesigning it whole. The happy zone named why the choir is fast -- the folds are pure and the world stays at the thin edge. Growing a language named the method the harness itself follows: diverge by strengthening, never by rewriting.
loom witness=caravan_ladder_carry carried=78265 ceiling=78271 fall=663 delegates=2736 modules=110 bodies=18159 distinct=7955 families=705
loom witness=caravan_suite rungs=107 verdict=GREEN
file caravan/ladder_checks.rye the lifted `lost_published` body, one published function over a comptime rung type
file caravan/abate.rye one of forty rungs whose twenty-line body became a one-line delegating stub
file caravan/bear.rye one of four rungs that widened `note_path` to `pub` because the harness asks for it now
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh the carry ceiling brought down to 78271
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish the measured carry, the delegate count, and the reordered fold queue
file crux/REMEMBER.md Now refilled with this lift, three prior edges condensed to one line, next crux named by realized fall
recommend keep-going press_path at twenty-eight rungs by twenty-seven lines -- about 648 by realized fall and already public in every rung, so it is the head that widens nothing while renew_path and ask_path both want a seam opened first
